'''Difficulty:''' ★★★★☆

'''Battle:''' While tricky, it's possible to chain Puffsley's Comet to death and finish the stage before Project A even has a chance to spawn. Simply wait until Puffsley's Comet hits the base, spawn Awakened Bahamut Cat, then summon 3 Manic Mohawk Cats at a 2.5-second interval to keep Puffsley from getting pushed back too far (or hitting Bahamut). Once the first Star Peng makes its way to the frontlines, let Bahamut trade hits with it so that they both recoil, while simultaneously restarting the Manic Mohawk chain to prevent puffsley from killing Bahamut thereafter. Puffsley's Comet should die right as the second Star Peng appears. Take care to protect Bahamut here, since he cannot tank another attack from Star Peng; start spamming both Lion Cats as soon as Puffsley's dead, and you can claim the victory then and there.

This is essentially a free clear, since you don't waste any anti-Aliens performing it. Try to pull it off to make resource allocation in later clears simpler!

